   "about": "The law protects information about manpower and materials available for military purposes.",
   "summary": "Law No. 25 of 1939 opens by authorizing ministers to designate secrets concerning production, storage, imports, skilled manpower, vehicles, aircraft, and horses. The document continues beyond this section.",
